  unitName: Chivalrous Thief Zelnite
  unitId: 30447
  unitNumber: 1441
  description: '"Stealing the curse that had been laid upon the Princess of the Wind,
    Zelnite saved the kingdom in its hour of need. Seeking new treasures, the gallant
    thief dashed through the moonlit night with his partner at his side. Even as
    he did, he held his unbreakable bond with the princess close to his heart...'
  summonDesc: Who am I, you ask?<br>I'm afraid only she may ever know.<br>I swore
    upon this crest!
  fusionDesc: Seems like there's some treasure here just begging to be stolen!<br>Let's
    go, partner!!
  evoDesc: As the stars slumber in the sky,<br>the chivalrous thief Zelnite<br>makes
    his grand entrance!<br>If you wish to be stolen, please step up!
